    "message": {
      "content": "# Validation Checklist: Multi-Node Language-Model Serving System\n\n## Scope and Preconditions\n\nBefore any validation run, establish the baseline:\n\n- [ ] **System topology documented**: number of nodes, GPUs per node, tensor-parallel (TP), pipeline-parallel (PP), expert-parallel (EP), and data-parallel (DP) degrees recorded.\n- [ ] **Serving framework and version pinned** (e.g., vLLM, TensorRT-LLM, SGLang, DeepSpeed-MII), including commit hash if built from source.\n- [ ] **Model artifact identity recorded**: model name, revision/commit, quantization scheme, dtype, and tokenizer version.\n- [ ] **Network fabric verified**: NCCL/RCCL version, interconnect type (IB, RoCE, NVLink domain boundaries), and a clean `all_reduce`/`all_gather` bandwidth test across all ranks.\n- [ ] **Baseline single-node or reference configuration results available** for comparison, if the goal is regression detection.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Configuration Identity\n\nGoal: prove that every rank and node believes it is running the *same* logical system.\n\n- [ ] **Config hash computed and compared across all ranks.** Hash the fully-resolved configuration (after CLI flags, env vars, YAML overrides, and defaults are merged) \u2014 not just the input file. Serialize deterministically (sorted keys, explicit dtypes) before hashing.\n- [ ] **Environment parity check per node:**\n  - [ ] CUDA/driver versions identical.\n  - [ ] NCCL version identical; `NCCL_DEBUG` output captured at `INFO` for at least one run.\n  - [ ] Python environment (key package versions) identical \u2014 compare `pip freeze` or container image digests.\n  - [ ] Container image digest (not tag) recorded per node.\n- [ ] **Effective parallelism confirmed at runtime**, not just from launch args: query the engine",
      "reasoning": "",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
